; ===== radio_a =====
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:46.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Hi — today's host is Sakamoto Erena.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:50.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This one's from radio name Misato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:52.62,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,"Erena-chan, congratulations on your graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:54.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Getting to support you for eleven and a half years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm the happiest person in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'll love you always, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I love you too!

; ===== radio_b =====
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.96,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone, please do the "save" with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Ready —

; ===== photo =====
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.52,0:17:53.00,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Good evening, everyone — we're HKT48
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:55.29,Default,All,0,0,60,,Team KIV!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:04.38,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Team KIV's "Koko ni Datte Tenshi wa Iru" show has begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:06.60,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,First up: Aoi Tsuki ga Miteru Kara,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:08.76,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Radio Name, Koko ni Datte Tenshi wa Iru,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.62,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and Cattleya no Hana wo Miru Tabi ni Omoidasu —
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.70,0:18:12.26,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,you've just heard four songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:13.72,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Everyone doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:19.24,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Today is Ere-tan-san's graduation show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:19.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:22.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It kind of feels like a birthday show,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:24.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it's a strange feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:26.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but I just hope we can enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:27.54,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:32.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Well then, let's take the photo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:33.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.46,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Radio Name was lovely, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:39.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,They brought so many letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:39.98,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.80,0:18:42.95,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:44.05,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Someone come stand next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.45,0:18:46.53,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Today's the only day!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,You were already crying, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:48.98,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:55.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:58.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,K-IV pose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then, a heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:21.84,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Then could you all squeeze in tight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:23.07,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.15,0:19:24.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.18,0:19:26.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's so hot in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.52,0:19:30.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:39.08,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,The photo we just took
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.74,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,will be sold in the lobby after the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.60,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,so please stop by as a graduation keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.68,0:19:43.66,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:45.46,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!

; ===== intro =====
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:54.48,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Thank you! Now let us introduce ourselves one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:57.82,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Today's theme is "my memories of Ere-tan." Akiyoshi-san, please start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:01.56,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Okay — when I say "I want to be," please say "I want to be!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:07.12,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I want to be a gentle flower blooming in Hakata!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.55,0:20:10.90,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.53,0:20:13.33,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I love acting and guitar — I'm Yuka-chan, Akiyoshi Yuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:18.60,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:22.30,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I have lots of memories of Ere-tan,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:25.90,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,but it's how she always gives me energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:31.68,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,There was a day at a show when I was feeling down,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.76,0:20:35.58,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and Ere-tan always cheers me up at times like that —
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:41.22,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,during a song in the show, when our eyes met,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:45.70,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,she mouthed "You can do it" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:48.84,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I almost cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:49.94,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,So after the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:53.10,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I went to tell her, "Ere-tan, thanks for that,"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.05,0:20:55.77,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and she said, "Seriously, what are you talking about?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.19,0:20:58.81,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I was like, "Huh? Huh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.97,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,"You know, during that song,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.37,0:21:04.25,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,when I was down, you told me 'You can do it,' right?" I said, and —
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:07.09,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,"Oh, I was just mouthing along to the song."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:07.89,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ehhh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:08.71,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.27,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.35,0:21:12.09,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,It was just me misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:14.81,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,In Cattleya, there's that part
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.89,0:21:16.79,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,with the lyric you all know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.87,0:21:20.01,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I was mouthing that, and I guess it looked like I said "You can do it."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.81,0:21:22.11,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.25,0:21:26.55,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Right? I was so embarrassed all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.75,0:21:28.21,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,In my heart, I was cheering you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.33,0:21:29.27,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,It cheered me up anyway. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:33.63,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,We went to the same high school too,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:37.51,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,and we sang together so much — I have so many memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.67,0:21:39.57,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,I'm going to liven things up today. Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.60,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Everyone — please look for Ere-tan-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:21:49.54,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:53.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.30,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Thank you, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.49,0:21:58.87,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,I'm always waiting right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.95,0:22:00.43,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,so come see me where Ere-tan-san is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:03.53,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,From Nagasaki Prefecture, 3rd year of high school, age 18 —
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:04.87,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,I'm Eguchi — Koko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.95,0:22:05.79,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Koko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.49,0:22:09.70,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.06,0:22:13.70,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Ever since I was promoted to Team KIV, Ere-tan-san has been
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:15.48,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,so kind — even in the dressing room
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:19.10,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,she talks to me casually, a gentle senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:21.64,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,always so friendly with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.72,0:22:23.30,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,and I really love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.72,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,I went out with Ere-tan-san just once —
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.80,0:22:28.86,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,we went to Miyajima the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.94,0:22:30.86,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Ere-tan-san, Kurumi-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:34.00,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Zawa-chan and me, the four of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.50,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Miyajima is pretty far, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.84,0:22:38.36,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,You even have to take a ferry,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:40.60,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,and getting there you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:42.66,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,change trains a bunch of times,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:45.08,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,and Ere-tan-san looked it all up for us —
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:50.68,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,the times, the costs, she researched everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.76,0:22:53.90,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Ere-tan-san is pretty laid-back, so I thought she wouldn't really —
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:54.92,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,you know, not so much —
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That's mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:58.76,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,— so it surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.38,0:23:04.04,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,But when she went out with me, she never looked anything up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.78,0:23:08.10,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,No, no — my phone's data was too slow to open anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.72,0:23:10.84,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,So I thought, what a cool senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:14.80,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,It was a really fun day, and I was so happy we made memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.88,0:23:20.42,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Today I want to burn Ere-tan-san into my eyes to the very end and really liven things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:21.88,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,Please look after us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:24.62,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:29.04,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,From Miyazaki Prefecture, Team KIV — I'm Jitoe Nene!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.12,0:23:30.04,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Nene-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:34.10,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.75,0:23:38.23,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,For me, Ere-tan-san means humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.93,0:23:41.57,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Ere-tan-san really is singing all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:44.81,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Especially during the unit part of the show —
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:50.05,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,a few of us go out at a time while the rest get ready backstage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:51.89,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,She sings that whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.97,0:23:54.87,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and not the normal melody — she sings the harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:57.63,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,She always sings notes I've never heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:24:00.01,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,so one day — this was really recent —
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.09,0:24:04.35,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,I told Ere-tan-san, "You sing the harmony every single time,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.43,0:24:07.49,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,so I've memorized the harmony to this song,"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:09.93,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and she said, "Huh? Was I singing?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.35,0:24:12.55,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,That's a bit much, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.63,0:24:15.05,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,You really sang it every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.55,0:24:16.73,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Every day she sings,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.81,0:24:18.71,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and she goes, "Huh, I was singing?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.13,0:24:21.75,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,I said, "Of course you were,"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.83,0:24:24.13,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and then during the unit part of that day's show,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.21,0:24:26.03,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,she was singing that song in harmony again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.63,0:24:27.51,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Totally unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.59,0:24:30.49,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,That's what's so great about Ere-tan-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.57,0:24:32.01,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,It gives me energy too,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.09,0:24:35.35,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,so I'll be really lonely when that's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.43,0:24:37.73,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and I hope she'll come sing anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.81,0:24:39.23,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Please look after us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.89,0:24:41.23,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:47.48,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Everyone, please clap and call along with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.68,0:24:51.66,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Ready, set — go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.18,0:24:54.46,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Looking sharp today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.52,0:24:54.98,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.98,0:24:56.02,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Coloring your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.10,0:24:56.68,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.68,0:24:58.26,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Congratulations, Erena-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.26,0:24:59.20,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Uu~
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:00.40,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.88,0:25:01.82,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:05.10,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,From Kumamoto Prefecture, Team KIV — I'm Morisaki Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.18,0:25:06.40,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.12,0:25:11.20,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.43,0:25:17.97,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,My very first location shoot after joining HKT48
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.05,0:25:20.07,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,was for "Fukuoka Satsueichuu,"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.15,0:25:22.65,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,a YouTube show.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.73,0:25:24.61,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,My partner then
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.69,0:25:25.61,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,was Erena-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.69,0:25:27.63,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,It was my first shoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.71,0:25:30.01,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and we went around Itoshima —
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.09,0:25:32.13,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,cycling half the way around it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.21,0:25:33.05,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,that kind of shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:36.49,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,It was really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.57,0:25:38.27,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,There were hills,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:40.51,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and the wind was strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.59,0:25:42.99,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and we were both gasping for breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.07,0:25:47.40,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,desperately panting — but somehow that became fun too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.48,0:25:50.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I was passing you a lot, though. I had it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.88,0:25:55.68,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,No, we both struggled — but we finished all smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:26:00.10,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,So today too, I want to finish all smiles
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.18,0:26:00.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Is that how it goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.14,0:26:05.70,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and see you off. Please look after us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:08.44,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.70,0:26:13.68,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Okay — when I point the mic, please say "Risaki!"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.22,0:26:14.86,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.94,0:26:18.13,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,From morning till night, I want to fill it up with Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.21,0:26:19.29,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:20.09,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.17,0:26:21.47,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.55,0:26:22.13,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.67,0:26:24.09,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,I caught everyone's hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.17,0:26:25.11,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,We're caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.05,0:26:27.85,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,I'm 20-year-old Oba Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.93,0:26:28.73,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Risaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.53,0:26:31.60,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:34.40,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,My memory with Erena-san
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.48,0:26:38.08,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,is my changing spot next to her in the dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.16,0:26:39.66,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Ever since I was promoted,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.74,0:26:43.24,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,I've changed next to Erena-san for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:44.66,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Hmm, isn't that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:46.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,a little dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.82,0:26:49.70,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Changing there, even when I had no energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.78,0:26:53.48,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,next to Erena-san I could hear her humming,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.06,0:26:57.54,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,and she'd ask "You okay?" and I'd really perk up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.62,0:27:00.44,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,So I'm worried whether I can change properly from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.80,0:27:03.06,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,but at those times I'll hum to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.42,0:27:05.74,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Today I'll give Erena-san a big send-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.82,0:27:06.70,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.38,0:27:09.00,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.29,0:27:14.09,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,Okay — always in everyone's hearts —
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.89,0:27:15.21,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Kokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.05,0:27:17.91,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,With this smile, energy into everyone's hearts —
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.99,0:27:18.95,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.59,0:27:20.75,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,I'll deliver lots of smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.83,0:27:23.27,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,1st year of high school, age 15 —
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.35,0:27:24.73,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,I'm Koko-ppe, Tachibana Kokoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.81,0:27:25.87,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Koko-ppe!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.08,0:27:29.18,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.15,0:27:32.81,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,My memory with Erena-san:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.67,0:27:36.53,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,my understudy debut was at a reset show,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.61,0:27:39.43,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,and Erena-san was in it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.51,0:27:40.75,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,At my understudy debut,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.83,0:27:43.25,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,right next to me —
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.61,0:27:44.87,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,I was super nervous —
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.00,0:27:47.70,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,she said so many kind things to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.18,0:27:50.38,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,and I thought, "Who is this kind senior?"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.46,0:27:52.18,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,That really stayed with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.96,0:27:54.88,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,so today I want to burn lots into my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.96,0:27:56.08,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,and make memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.16,0:27:57.84,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,Please look after us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.90,0:28:04.39,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,When you say angel-like little devil —
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.99,0:28:06.91,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Karen-ren!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.90,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I wanna be Erena's angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.70,0:28:11.72,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.80,0:28:15.14,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,From Nagasaki Prefecture, age 18 — I'm Karen-ren, Fukui Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.22,0:28:15.68,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.00,0:28:16.90,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.16,0:28:25.38,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I've gone out to eat with Erena-san a lot —
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:27.74,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,maybe the most out of all my seniors,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.82,0:28:30.46,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,she's taken me out quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:34.04,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Last time, when Erena-san and I went for shabu-shabu,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:37.52,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I said, "Next time I'll treat you to ramen,"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.60,0:28:39.48,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and we still haven't gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.04,0:28:43.02,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,so after she graduates I want to go for ramen about ten times
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.10,0:28:44.94,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and treat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:46.70,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Today I want to watch her a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.34,0:28:48.14,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:50.18,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.47,0:28:55.43,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I want to wrap Ere-chan's heart up as Kuru-mi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.00,0:28:57.97,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.05,0:28:59.77,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I'm Kuru-tan, Takemoto Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.85,0:29:00.79,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Kuru-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.19,0:29:05.29,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.49,0:29:08.89,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,My memories with Ere-chan — there are so many
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.97,0:29:12.01,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I can't even count them,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.09,0:29:16.71,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,but the moment I felt we'd gotten really close
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.79,0:29:18.55,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,was when I was really struggling —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.63,0:29:20.69,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,with university entrance exams and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.77,0:29:22.33,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,and worrying about the group —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:25.57,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,we weren't super close yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.65,0:29:27.31,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,but she invited me to dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.13,0:29:30.83,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,and listened to me a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.91,0:29:33.49,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I told her, "You saved me back then,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.57,0:29:35.63,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,and it was classic Ere-chan:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.45,0:29:38.03,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,"Did I do that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.71,0:29:39.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I remember what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.83,0:29:42.67,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,"Was that a thing?" —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.75,0:29:44.25,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,"Well, glad it helped" —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.00,0:29:46.54,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,that kind of vibe really saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.62,0:29:48.08,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,She's always positive —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.16,0:29:50.26,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,positive, positive —
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.34,0:29:52.50,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,she put me in a positive mood, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.58,0:29:54.18,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I'm a bit anxious about what's next,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.10,0:29:56.40,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,so could we do video calls
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.36,0:29:58.74,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,in the dressing room?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.82,0:30:00.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Anytime — I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.66,0:30:03.24,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Then could you come to the dressing room?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.56,0:30:03.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.00,0:30:05.78,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.54,0:30:07.98,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,You said it just now, for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.60,0:30:09.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We were next to each other the whole time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:11.98,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Yes — since we were next to each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.06,0:30:13.26,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,today too —
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.34,0:30:15.10,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,um, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.46,0:30:17.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Today too,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.96,0:30:19.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,let's have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.42,0:30:20.18,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Let's enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.48,0:30:22.56,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.64,0:30:25.08,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.41,0:30:29.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay, I'll do my old catchphrase,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.68,0:30:31.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so after I sing,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.88,0:30:32.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,please say "Yay!"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:34.66,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.74,0:30:36.15,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:38.33,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.41,0:30:42.09,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,♪ Today is Ere-chan's graduation show,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.17,0:30:45.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,♪ let's all have a crazy good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.27,0:30:47.05,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.13,0:30:47.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.56,0:30:50.43,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm Team KIV's Ere-tan, Sakamoto Erena!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.51,0:30:52.05,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ere-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.25,0:31:00.69,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Wow, the illustrations are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:03.53,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So cute — a taiko drum and me! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.31,0:31:05.81,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So much "Ere" everywhere — thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.28,0:31:08.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.87,0:31:10.41,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,My memories with myself? —
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.87,0:31:12.23,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Kuru-tan's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.31,0:31:13.17,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Kuru-tan's crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.25,0:31:17.07,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,For me, it's my memories with the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:19.03,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,After eleven years — eleven and a half —
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.11,0:31:20.97,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,of all kinds of activities,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.05,0:31:23.47,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I really have all kinds of memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.55,0:31:26.69,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but today really is my last time on this stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.77,0:31:30.15,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I want today to be the best day ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:31.91,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone, let's have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.99,0:31:32.79,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:41.50,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,When I point the mic, please wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.58,0:31:42.24,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:49.72,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,In charge of warm smiles — I'll turn today into an eternal day for Erena-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:51.60,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.54,0:31:56.74,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,From Fukuoka Prefecture, born in summer, age 18 — I'm Izawa Miyu! Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.11,0:31:59.90,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.80,0:32:09.92,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,My memories with Erena-san — there are too many to count,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.00,0:32:15.80,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,but one is that in theater shows we're often next to, or near, or paired with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.44,0:32:24.24,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Today too, in Cattleya no Hana wo Miru Tabi ni Omoidasu,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.07,0:32:29.81,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,there's a part where we face each other like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.89,0:32:33.21,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,but it's not a solo singing line,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.29,0:32:34.93,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so DMM doesn't put us on camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.01,0:32:39.23,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So I'd secretly make funny faces at her,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.31,0:32:41.09,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,but today is really the last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.63,0:32:44.33,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so I wanted to show her my best pun
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.41,0:32:47.27,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and make her smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.35,0:32:48.83,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and I was doing it like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.91,0:32:53.03,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and right then she said "Good luck" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.11,0:32:54.33,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Did she really say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.41,0:32:54.97,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That one's for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.05,0:32:55.93,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She said it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.01,0:32:56.71,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Was it just mouthing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.79,0:32:57.73,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I really said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.21,0:32:59.41,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This time I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.49,0:33:01.03,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This time I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.11,0:33:01.49,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This one I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.57,0:33:02.91,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It wasn't just the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.99,0:33:04.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I said it, I said it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.27,0:33:07.19,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Right, she said kind words like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.27,0:33:10.57,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so in the end I couldn't show this week's pun,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.65,0:33:13.25,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,but we pair up lots more later,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.33,0:33:13.69,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.77,0:33:15.63,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so I'll show it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.71,0:33:18.87,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Today I want to see Erena-san off with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.95,0:33:19.77,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.85,0:33:22.27,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.50,0:33:26.20,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Okay, when I point the mic,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.28,0:33:27.66,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,please say "Han-chaka-chan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.10,0:33:28.90,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.98,0:33:31.84,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Everyone's love, tied together with bonds —
Dialogue: 1,0:33:29.98,0:33:33.92,Default,Note,0,0,60,,{\an8}Note: Hanna's name 絆愛 is written with the kanji for "bond" (kizuna) and "love" (ai)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.92,0:33:33.92,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Han-chaka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.00,0:33:35.43,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.51,0:33:38.61,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,From Oita Prefecture, 3rd year of junior high, age 14 —
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.69,0:33:40.39,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I'm the slightly scatterbrained Ihara Hanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.47,0:33:42.47,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Please call me Han-chaka-chan! Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.55,0:33:43.75,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Han-chaka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.30,0:33:48.88,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:50.98,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,My memories with Ere-tan-san —
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.06,0:33:52.76,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I have lots too,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.84,0:33:55.32,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,but especially when Ere-tan-san and I
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.40,0:33:58.90,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,went out, just the two of us, we ate,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.98,0:34:00.54,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,then went to a clothing store
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.62,0:34:02.34,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,to look at clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.82,0:34:05.34,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and the clothes Ere-tan-san bought there
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.42,0:34:08.34,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,she wore as her outfit
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.42,0:34:10.76,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,for her last high-touch event!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.84,0:34:11.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We picked it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.82,0:34:12.46,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.54,0:34:16.84,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I wondered if I should be choosing such important clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.92,0:34:20.58,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,but I want to brag about it to the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.66,0:34:22.36,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Please look after us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.44,0:34:24.56,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.55,0:34:30.73,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Okay — rin-rin —
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.81,0:34:31.89,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.41,0:34:34.21,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Step by step, from the little things —
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.61,0:34:36.87,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,my charm point is my big sparkly eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.95,0:34:40.65,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,From Hyogo Prefecture, 3rd year of high school, age 17 — I'm Ouchi Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.73,0:34:41.77,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.63,0:34:45.78,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.92,0:34:49.04,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,This is a very Erena-san kind of story:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.46,0:34:53.98,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,you'd think announcing your graduation would make you really nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.06,0:34:58.94,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,but the day before, she actually came to a takoyaki party,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.02,0:35:00.90,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,at Kurina-san's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.68,0:35:06.56,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,I thought she might be too nervous to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.64,0:35:08.26,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,but she was wolfing down takoyaki,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.34,0:35:12.64,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,so bright you'd never have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.72,0:35:16.62,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,I'll be so lonely once she's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.70,0:35:19.68,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,but today I want to burn Erena-san into my eyes and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.76,0:35:21.32,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Please look after us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.94,0:35:23.88,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.60,0:35:27.28,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Okay — born February 9, Meat Day —
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.36,0:35:29.08,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Beef tongue, pork tongue —
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.16,0:35:30.74,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hina-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.82,0:35:31.34,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.42,0:35:33.38,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,My charm point is being super energetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.46,0:35:35.64,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,From the hometown Ere-chan loves —
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:38.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Just your name left!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.78,0:35:40.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Almost there, almost!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.08,0:35:44.12,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,3rd year of junior high, age 14, Team KIV — I'm Yasui Hina!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.37,0:35:49.71,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.63,0:35:52.65,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,My memory with Ere-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.73,0:35:55.35,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,is from the day before yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.43,0:35:59.49,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I felt like I'd never recover without Ere-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.57,0:36:02.23,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,that's what I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.31,0:36:04.53,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,and without me saying anything to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.31,0:36:07.41,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,out of the blue I got a LINE from Ere-chan:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.49,0:36:10.09,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,"You okay right now?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.55,0:36:13.25,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I said "I'm okay," and she called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.47,0:36:15.72,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,"Isn't it hard right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.80,0:36:19.30,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,"You're lonely, right?" — like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.28,0:36:21.90,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Who says "you're lonely, right?" about themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.30,0:36:23.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Nobody says that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.10,0:36:24.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You don't! You can't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.12,0:36:26.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That was a touching moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.52,0:36:29.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Right? You were happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.58,0:36:35.26,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I was so happy — and then on the phone, I was like, "Okay,"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.36,0:36:37.70,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,you know how you hold the phone like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.98,0:36:40.72,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,And she said, "Can you see me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.18,0:36:41.91,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,and I was like, um —
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.99,0:36:44.57,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,"Am I being watched?"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.65,0:36:45.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.08,0:36:47.33,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I was near my house,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.77,0:36:49.45,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,so I thought someone was watching me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.53,0:36:51.37,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,but when I looked at my phone, it was a video call!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.49,0:36:53.39,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Awkward!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.79,0:36:55.91,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,So she was just looking at your ear the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.86,0:37:00.54,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I looked, and there was Ere-chan on the screen,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.62,0:37:03.16,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,and I burst into tears right in front of my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.56,0:37:06.86,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I caused my neighbors a lot of trouble —
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.04,0:37:10.52,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I was really wailing,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.60,0:37:14.34,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,so I'm sorry for bothering the neighbors,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.42,0:37:18.22,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,but seeing Ere-chan's smile, I felt so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.76,0:37:21.30,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Today I want to meet Ere-chan's eyes a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.18,0:37:22.50,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.65,0:37:33.29,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,When you think Oita — hot springs, shiitake, pears, and Boss! From Oita Prefecture, age 24 — I'm Kuriyama Rina!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.52,0:37:38.62,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Sorry — thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.28,0:37:43.60,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Ere-tan-san and I went out to eat now and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.54,0:37:44.72,Default,Member,0,0,60,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.00,0:37:48.48,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,and once the two of us went to a certain Chinese restaurant Kiyoshi-san loves —
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.96,0:37:50.34,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,I forgot the name for a second —
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:52.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ni-no-ni.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.86,0:37:56.80,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Someone said it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.24,0:37:58.06,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,I heard it for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.14,0:37:59.80,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,When we were at Ni-no-ni,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.88,0:38:02.68,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,we ordered sesame balls for dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.76,0:38:05.00,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Anyone who's had them will know,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.08,0:38:09.74,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,the sesame balls there have a slightly gooey bean-paste filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.30,0:38:12.14,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,I felt like goofing around,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.22,0:38:15.70,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,and after eating, I showed Ere-tan-san the black stuff stuck all over my front teeth:
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.78,0:38:17.68,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,"Hey, look — blackened teeth!"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.76,0:38:19.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.28,0:38:22.44,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,I showed her my black teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.52,0:38:26.02,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,I thought Ere-tan-san would be grossed out,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.10,0:38:27.38,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,but she put some on too,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.62,0:38:31.88,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,and showed me, "Me too!"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.44,0:38:36.86,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,That was so cute and so Ere-tan-san — it's a fun memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.94,0:38:39.64,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,She often calls me a weird kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.72,0:38:41.74,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,but she smiles a lot with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.82,0:38:44.00,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,so today I hope I can keep Ere-tan-san smiling to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.08,0:38:45.14,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.69,0:38:52.63,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,From Gunma Prefecture, age 21, Team KIV — I'm Imamura Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.71,0:38:53.49,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Maria!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.20,0:38:57.50,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.57,0:39:01.35,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,I've been with Ere-chan ever since I joined —
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.43,0:39:04.91,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,as trainees, in Team TII, in Team KIV, always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.29,0:39:08.53,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,We used to eat curry rice and drink juice at Ere-chan's place,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.61,0:39:12.55,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,and before I knew it, it's turned into snacks and drinks with alcohol —
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.63,0:39:15.43,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,we've spent such a long time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.51,0:39:19.09,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Around Ere-chan I turn into a little sister and get really clingy,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.17,0:39:21.33,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,so today I'll cling a lot to the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.41,0:39:23.73,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,while also showing her I can stand on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.81,0:39:25.31,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Please look after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.73,0:39:26.97,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.43,0:39:32.01,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Okay — my birthday is August 31, Vegetable Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.09,0:39:33.69,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,What I (dago) love is Ere-tan-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.77,0:39:35.53,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,From Kumamoto Prefecture — I'm Tanaka Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.61,0:39:36.39,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.48,0:39:40.12,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Thank you, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.76,0:39:44.76,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,My memory with Ere-tan-san is from a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.00,0:39:47.50,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,before we were in the same team, KIV.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.58,0:39:52.34,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,After work, Ere-tan-san, Oimo-san and I went to dinner, the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.42,0:39:54.52,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,What a strange combination, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:59.92,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,I wasn't used to talking with seniors yet, so my heart was pounding,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.00,0:40:02.14,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,but she talked to me so casually,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.22,0:40:05.12,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,and the three of us talked for about three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.20,0:40:08.82,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,I'm sorry I was so nervous I don't remember much of what we said,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.90,0:40:12.04,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,but today — they're serious songs —
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.12,0:40:14.24,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,there are a few more spots where our eyes meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.32,0:40:16.20,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,so I want to meet her eyes lots there
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.28,0:40:18.08,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,and make Ere-tan-san smile a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.16,0:40:19.84,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Please look after us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.26,0:40:21.44,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.97,0:40:27.39,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Team KIV's "Koko ni Datte Tenshi wa Iru" show,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.47,0:40:28.77,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Sakamoto Erena Graduation Performance —
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.85,0:40:30.55,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,today's show is brought to you by these members!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.05,0:40:32.35,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Everyone — I bet Ere-tan-san
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.43,0:40:34.41,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,doesn't like a gloomy atmosphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.11,0:40:36.95,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Can you still get louder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.37,0:40:41.87,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Can you sound prettier than Ere-tan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.58,0:40:44.97,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.05,0:40:47.35,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Now the various units take the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.43,0:40:48.39,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,First up, this one!

; ===== nando =====
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.41,0:50:27.33,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Everyone — congratulations on your graduation!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.81,0:50:30.41,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Now everyone, let's all say "Ere-Ere-Ere"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.49,0:50:33.55,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and send her a cheer so she keeps having fun from here on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.63,0:50:34.91,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ready —
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:36.65,Default,All,0,0,60,,Ere-Ere-Ere!

; ===== mc1 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.20,1:03:11.70,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.24,1:03:20.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.98,1:03:26.22,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Yume no Dead Body, Nando mo Nerae!, ONEW no Uwabaki,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.30,1:03:28.64,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Kono Sekai ga Yuki no Naka ni Umoreru Mae ni,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.72,1:03:30.98,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and Zipper — you've just heard five songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.06,1:03:31.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.27,1:03:39.79,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Since today is Erena-san's graduation show,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.25,1:03:43.85,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,we've brought a segment about Erena-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.51,1:03:50.85,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Using Erena-san's name, "E-re-na,"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.93,1:03:55.09,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,each member made an acrostic poem,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.81,1:03:59.15,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and we'd like you all to pick the best one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.21,1:04:07.85,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,When each member presents,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.93,1:04:12.63,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,when I say "Ready," please say it together with me —
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.71,1:04:17.23,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,three times: "E," "re," "na," and the members present along.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.89,1:04:20.73,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Like, "Ready — E!"
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.81,1:04:21.71,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.79,1:04:24.90,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.98,1:04:25.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.94,1:04:29.88,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Then I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.96,1:04:30.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.70,1:04:32.96,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Then shall I say "Ready"?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.04,1:04:33.74,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.82,1:04:39.11,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,(All: E!) Everest-class —
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.65,1:04:43.62,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,(All: Re!) on a whole other level —
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.18,1:04:48.36,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,(All: Na!) long legs!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.44,1:04:49.74,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.98,1:04:54.64,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Great reactions — I'm happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.16,1:04:56.60,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,About Erena-san…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.00,1:05:00.50,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.08,1:05:01.56,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.29,1:05:07.75,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,(All: E!) If you mix Ere-nee's tears
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.25,1:05:12.55,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,(All: Re!) with liver-and-chive stir-fry,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.63,1:05:14.37,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,what would it taste like?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.59,1:05:18.83,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,(All: Na!) Naturally fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.96,1:05:20.82,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.74,1:05:23.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What? Liver and chives?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.30,1:05:26.90,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Tears and liver stir-fry —
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.74,1:05:28.98,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,mixed together?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.06,1:05:31.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Ugh, I don't want to mix them!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.74,1:05:34.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I don't really get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.98,1:05:37.86,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Well, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.18,1:05:41.94,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Ready — E!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.79,1:05:45.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,E-rena-san's graduating today!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.78,1:05:47.90,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Ready — Re!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.90,1:05:51.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Re… To a red panda —
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.22,1:05:54.20,Default,All,0,0,60,,Ready — Na!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.59,1:05:57.56,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Na… let's go get comforted.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.90,1:05:59.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.72,1:06:02.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.50,1:06:07.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Re" is the hard one, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.12,1:06:09.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,For the hard "Re" — a red panda.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.30,1:06:12.02,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,A red panda — like you mixed something in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.10,1:06:17.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,A red panda, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.39,1:06:19.55,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Okay, let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.12,1:06:22.32,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Hina-tan, ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.22,1:06:23.66,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.74,1:06:24.82,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.70,1:06:29.42,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,(All: E!) Ere-chan —
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.36,1:06:32.20,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,(All: Re!) Re —
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.28,1:06:35.76,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,during lessons, during rehearsals, in the dressing room,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.84,1:06:37.52,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,always humming!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.00,1:06:39.94,Default,All,0,0,60,,Ready — Na!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.02,1:06:42.04,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Nothing's off limits!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.20,1:06:44.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Wow, that's
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.59,1:06:45.61,Default,Member,0,0,60,,really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.69,1:06:48.78,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,The "Re" was super long, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.86,1:06:50.76,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What did you say for lessons?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.88,1:06:54.30,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,"During lessons, rehearsals, in the dressing room —
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.38,1:06:56.02,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,humming is okay."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.10,1:06:57.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Humming's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.22,1:06:58.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:06:59.32,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Always humming.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.40,1:06:59.84,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.00,1:07:03.16,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,That's so like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.76,1:07:05.72,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Next, let's go with Han-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.80,1:07:12.30,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,(All: E!) "Ere-Ere-Ere" spread so little that
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.12,1:07:18.65,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,(All: Re!) I tried eating a lemon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.41,1:07:23.77,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,(All: Na!) Nothing changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.19,1:07:26.97,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I don't get it at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.05,1:07:29.96,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,But this is actually true!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.04,1:07:31.56,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,"Ere-Ere-Ere" —
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.64,1:07:33.92,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,on the HKT48 Tottoto YouTube channel —
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.00,1:07:36.04,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,developed? No, not developed —
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.96,1:07:37.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Invented?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.88,1:07:39.30,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I invented it,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.38,1:07:43.92,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,but whenever I say "Ere-Ere-Ere," the room goes cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.40,1:07:45.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Oh, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.22,1:07:48.30,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,So I really wish I'd spread "Ere-Ere-Ere" more
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.38,1:07:51.38,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,while Ere-tan-san was still here —
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.46,1:07:53.06,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I deeply regret it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.52,1:07:56.26,Default,Oba Risaki,0,0,60,,But the "Ere-Ere-Ere" pose goes like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.34,1:07:56.82,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.42,1:07:59.08,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,It means, like, "Come here."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.16,1:08:01.52,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I did this at DMM's camera a lot today.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.98,1:08:04.22,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,So it might catch on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.20,1:08:06.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Huh? Did it catch on?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.80,1:08:09.88,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Saa-chan said it at the end of Nando mo Nerae! too, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.96,1:08:12.92,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,We all said "Ere-Ere-Ere," didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.37,1:08:17.93,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,So maybe it caught on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.01,1:08:18.71,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It caught on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.79,1:08:21.31,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,Everyone, please use it — "Ere-Ere-Ere," please!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.19,1:08:25.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Scary, scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.39,1:08:26.99,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The mood got scary, but
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.07,1:08:31.61,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,let's decide the best poem!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.69,1:08:33.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Can we even decide?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.61,1:08:35.21,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Everyone will…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.24,1:08:37.28,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.36,1:08:41.20,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,If you liked Saa-chan's acrostic,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.22,1:08:45.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,quite a few!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.18,1:08:46.48,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Long legs."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.66,1:08:50.22,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,If you liked Karen-ren's,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.46,1:08:52.44,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.00,1:09:01.00,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,If you liked Hina-tan's?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.46,1:09:03.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's quite a lot!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.12,1:09:06.86,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,If you liked Han-chan's?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.68,1:09:10.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Saaya-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.58,1:09:12.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Saa-chan, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.32,1:09:14.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Long legs" after all?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.46,1:09:20.26,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,So this time's Erena acrostic grand prize goes to…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.34,1:09:25.78,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,"Everest-class, on a whole other level, long legs"!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.26,1:09:34.18,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Thank you for playing along!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.26,1:09:37.04,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,And so, Team KIV's "Koko ni Datte
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.12,1:09:39.12,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Tenshi wa Iru" show still goes on!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.20,1:09:41.34,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Everyone, can you still
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.42,1:09:43.12,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,cheer lots for Erena?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:47.38,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Let's have fun together!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.46,1:09:48.80,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Next up, this song.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.88,1:09:49.36,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Here you go!

; ===== mc2 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.50,1:22:26.20,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Hajimete no Hoshi, 100-nen Saki demo, Ribbon nante Niawanai —
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.29,1:22:28.27,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,you've just heard three songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.35,1:22:29.95,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Ere-chan, how's it been so far?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.39,1:22:33.47,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,From the very moment the curtain opened,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.55,1:22:36.61,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I could really feel everyone getting emotional,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.69,1:22:38.01,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but your calls are so loud,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.57,1:22:42.83,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I've really felt the power of your voices
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.91,1:22:44.97,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,as I've danced happily up to now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.05,1:22:46.20,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.48,1:22:54.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It honestly still hasn't really sunk in for me,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.08,1:22:58.04,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but seeing all of you crying,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.12,1:23:01.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm savoring each song, thinking, "Today really is the last."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.58,1:23:03.23,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.06,1:23:10.68,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,And so — sadly — the next song is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.68,1:23:14.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.14,1:23:16.18,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Now please listen:
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.68,1:23:17.70,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Degas to Ballerina.

; ===== mc3 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.86,1:38:11.10,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,You've just heard Jounetsu Highway.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.18,1:38:13.30,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,Everyone, thank you for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.65,1:38:15.80,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.42,1:38:27.10,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,Okay — Erena-san is in this MC, so how are you feeling right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.80,1:38:30.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Um, I don't know — but it's fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.56,1:38:31.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.36,1:38:32.44,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It still hasn't sunk in.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.70,1:38:33.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.98,1:38:35.48,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Even though it's already the encore.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.58,1:38:35.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.62,1:38:39.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It feels like I'll be in the next show too.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.58,1:38:39.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.38,1:38:42.62,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Because, you know, the intro to Highway too —
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.70,1:38:44.64,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,when I said, "Let's make it the Ere-tan-san version today,"
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.72,1:38:48.90,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Ere-tan-san was like, "Anything's fine — I get to decide?"
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.98,1:38:49.96,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Anything makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.04,1:38:50.80,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,It's fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.18,1:38:54.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,But today there are probably people watching for the first time in a long while,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.48,1:38:57.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and people who came from all sorts of talk events,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.74,1:38:59.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.46,1:39:00.04,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.64,1:39:07.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Already lost it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.58,1:39:10.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Such a gloomy story, Hinata —
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.34,1:39:13.16,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,No, we'll see her off with smiles, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.58,1:39:14.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.30,1:39:16.98,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I already teared up a little at the first one.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.04,1:39:19.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The lyrics, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.32,1:39:20.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's a good song, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.24,1:39:22.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Today, the part Nene-chan usually sings —
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.82,1:39:24.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,she let me start it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.36,1:39:26.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.54,1:39:28.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.18,1:39:29.68,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,It's pressure on me now —
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.76,1:39:31.60,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,you're too good.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.66,1:39:34.80,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,It's a voice that goes straight to the heart, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.88,1:39:37.12,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,I thought it was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.88,1:39:40.18,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,4,195 days — that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.26,1:39:41.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.10,1:39:42.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.20,1:39:45.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,4,195 days.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.16,1:39:46.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.96,1:39:48.76,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really, truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.58,1:39:52.05,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Does anyone have an Ere-tan episode?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.07,1:39:54.89,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That's what this MC is for, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.00,1:39:55.82,Default,Member,0,0,60,,There are lots, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.90,1:39:56.38,Default,Member,0,0,60,,There are.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.76,1:39:58.84,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Too many.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.04,1:40:01.54,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Today's unit —
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.62,1:40:04.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,with Zawa-chan and Kuru-tan, the three of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.58,1:40:06.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,we got to do ONEW no Uwabaki,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.58,1:40:06.98,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I was happy!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.54,1:40:09.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.58,1:40:11.56,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I thought it'd be the guitar one —
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.64,1:40:14.40,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I thought it'd be the guitar one or Zipper,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.48,1:40:15.68,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,so being chosen,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.76,1:40:17.12,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,the two of us were like "Woo!"
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.18,1:40:19.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I was torn,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.74,1:40:22.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but for the last time, I really wanted to
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.46,1:40:24.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,sing together with the members.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.92,1:40:26.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The reason I picked those two:
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.68,1:40:28.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,the three of us actually go out to eat quite a lot,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.06,1:40:31.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and once on the way home from dinner,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.62,1:40:32.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,there was a park,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.36,1:40:35.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and the three of us played in the park like kids —
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.48,1:40:37.54,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that was so much fun,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.62,1:40:39.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and that time was just
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.30,1:40:40.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,too precious,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.54,1:40:43.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I thought then, I want to sing with these two at the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.60,1:40:45.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That was what started it?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.12,1:40:46.06,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Pumping on the swings like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.14,1:40:48.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,swinging,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.10,1:40:49.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and we played tag too.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.00,1:40:52.38,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,We did! — I was getting sore muscles!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.84,1:40:56.46,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,We'd eaten so much dinner,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.54,1:41:00.48,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so we said, let's burn it off with some exercise in the park.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.56,1:41:04.02,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So we went to the park and I said, "Shall we play tag?"
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.10,1:41:06.10,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,but she was like, "No way, I can't move" —
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.18,1:41:09.28,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and then about three minutes later, Ere-tan-san
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.36,1:41:12.18,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,said "Tag!" and tag began.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.96,1:41:15.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So cute — it was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.12,1:41:20.46,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,The cutest thing was —
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.54,1:41:23.36,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,there's this playground thing like a slide, where you climb up high,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.44,1:41:26.16,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,and when Zawachi was "it," she kept going after Ere-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.24,1:41:28.66,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,and Ere-chan got genuinely scared — "Stop, really,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.74,1:41:31.24,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,please stop!"
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.32,1:41:34.44,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Because Zawachi doesn't just chase you normally, she goes like this —
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.52,1:41:36.16,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.24,1:41:37.68,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's super scary!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.18,1:41:39.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Dead serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.08,1:41:43.22,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,But even after she graduates, the three of us are going out to eat — we've made plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.30,1:41:44.92,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Then invite me for tag!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.12,1:41:47.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The one least likely to come —
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.42,1:41:50.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,will you come to the park?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.40,1:41:52.32,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I'll try, I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.94,1:41:53.86,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She'll never come.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.00,1:41:58.74,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And Ere-tan submitted a proposal to the staff
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.26,1:42:01.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and made a singing show happen —
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.72,1:42:04.16,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I was really happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.41,1:42:05.21,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.38,1:42:10.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,When I decided to graduate, I thought about whether I had anything left undone,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.90,1:42:13.14,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I really wanted to do a singing show.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.22,1:42:15.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I felt I just couldn't give up on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.42,1:42:18.68,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,There were a few times it fell through,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.76,1:42:21.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but I didn't give up and kept saying "Please," and it became possible,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.96,1:42:23.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and everyone was really happy about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.06,1:42:25.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I'm glad I did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.98,1:42:32.24,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,We were high school classmates, and in a high school class,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.84,1:42:36.52,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,when we were 18 — so six years ago — a song we made
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.60,1:42:39.26,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,she finally performed at that singing live!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.34,1:42:40.92,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,Without that, it would have
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.34,1:42:42.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,stayed shelved forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.28,1:42:43.02,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.10,1:42:45.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We ate kalbi bowls together in the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.84,1:42:47.84,Default,Akiyoshi Yuka,0,0,60,,We always dashed to the cafeteria, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.66,1:42:50.14,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Nene-chan was a classmate too, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.22,1:42:50.48,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Yes, I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.22,1:42:53.44,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I heard so much about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.70,1:42:57.70,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,We ate karaage bowls and stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.46,1:42:58.82,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.30,1:43:01.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Was that how it was?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.08,1:43:02.43,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.51,1:43:04.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.26,1:43:05.58,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,Hina-tan's amazing too —
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.98,1:43:07.80,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,partway through, her tears wouldn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.88,1:43:08.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Hina-tan, you're crying too much!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.56,1:43:12.56,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,She cries whenever it's a memory story.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.64,1:43:15.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Hina-tan didn't start today —
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.08,1:43:16.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,she's been crying since the previous show.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.62,1:43:19.30,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And she hasn't said a single word yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.38,1:43:19.94,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.02,1:43:21.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Like, talking —
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.56,1:43:21.98,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I'm sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.06,1:43:22.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,— telling her things.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.98,1:43:23.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You're sad?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.96,1:43:26.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.16,1:43:27.86,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's sad, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.94,1:43:30.24,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Once you say it out loud, it gets sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.32,1:43:35.04,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,But for today, she brought matching keychains for Ere-chan, Kurumi and Hina-tan!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.12,1:43:36.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.40,1:43:38.70,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Besties forever, then —
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.78,1:43:41.90,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,she brought them, saying "I'll give them to you later."
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.98,1:43:43.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Besties forever, forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.26,1:43:45.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.12,1:43:46.44,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.08,1:43:49.98,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,it's already the encore,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.06,1:43:52.38,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,but I want to make lots of memories with Erena-san to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.46,1:43:53.90,Default,Tachibana Kokoro,0,0,60,,Next, the second-half group.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.98,1:43:54.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.56,1:44:04.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The second-half group will talk with these members.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.76,1:44:05.96,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Okay, Kurina-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.04,1:44:08.38,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,I'm a huge fan of Ere-tan-san's legs —
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.46,1:44:10.30,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,the "Ere-legs" —
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.42,1:44:13.48,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,and after she graduates,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.56,1:44:16.64,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,I won't get to see those legs up close anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.14,1:44:19.90,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,In particular, there's a scene where I think,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.50,1:44:22.56,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,"What a nice view."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.04,1:44:23.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.34,1:44:24.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is it fine?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.16,1:44:25.52,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.76,1:44:27.20,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,It's fine — everyone's probably thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.94,1:44:29.50,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,In Degas to Ballerina,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.58,1:44:31.26,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Ere-tan-san dances alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.78,1:44:34.56,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,At that moment I'm crouching down over there like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.40,1:44:37.56,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,but that song isn't a cheerful one,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.64,1:44:39.36,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,so I can't exactly look at Ere-tan-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.44,1:44:41.32,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,and I can't look at the fans in front either,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.40,1:44:43.88,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,so my gaze kind of —
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.96,1:44:44.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,you lower it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.62,1:44:45.64,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,It goes straight ahead, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.72,1:44:50.12,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,And as a result, all I can see is Ere-tan-san's legs from the waist down.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.38,1:44:56.48,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,So all this time I've been sitting there quietly gazing at them like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.56,1:44:57.72,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,You've been savoring them.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.80,1:45:00.44,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Yes — so it's quite a shock that I won't see them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.76,1:45:06.88,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,So for the last time, at today's rehearsal I got to touch her legs quite a bit —
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.96,1:45:09.66,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,No, you didn't touch them — you went in for a hug!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.74,1:45:15.54,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,In fact, at rehearsal what she wore was a bit short, so I tried looking up from below.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.36,1:45:19.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,No more than that!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.76,1:45:25.64,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,So if anyone wants to feel Ere-tan-san's legs, come to my high-touch lane —
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.72,1:45:27.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.96,1:45:28.36,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.28,1:45:31.94,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Both my hands have Ere-tan-san's legs on them now,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.84,1:45:34.08,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,so please come!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.16,1:45:35.20,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.28,1:45:36.84,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,I love her legs too —
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.92,1:45:38.64,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,I've touched them before.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.72,1:45:39.52,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,They're great, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.80,1:45:43.74,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,They're really smooth, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.82,1:45:45.20,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,And pale,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.28,1:45:46.16,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and slim.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.24,1:45:49.02,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,I watch them the whole time during Degas to Ballerina too,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.10,1:45:50.78,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,and since today's the last,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.86,1:45:54.02,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,from the morning I've been wondering if I could touch Ere-tan-san's legs,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.10,1:45:54.96,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,aiming for the right moment,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.72,1:45:57.60,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,but I still haven't touched them.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.68,1:45:58.58,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Ha, I won!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.28,1:46:00.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yes, we fought over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.34,1:46:03.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Don't fight over that!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.24,1:46:10.84,Default,Member,0,0,60,,But I'm a huge fan of Erena-san's mom's gluten-free sweets.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.50,1:46:12.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.96,1:46:17.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The moment I took a bite, it was so good I thought, "So this is what 'my cheeks are falling off' means."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.00,1:46:19.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I asked Erena-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.98,1:46:21.52,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"What's in it?"
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.60,1:46:24.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I asked, "It has a gentle sweetness,"
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.16,1:46:26.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and she said, "It doesn't even use white sugar."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.20,1:46:30.82,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Can something be sweet without sugar?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.36,1:46:33.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It can, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.32,1:46:35.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I was so surprised, I told Erena-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.76,1:46:38.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"So it tasted like Erena-san's mom!" —
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.42,1:46:39.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I told her on LINE.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.98,1:46:42.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And she never replied to that,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.02,1:46:45.76,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,so I wondered what that meant.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.84,1:46:48.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So I thought, only the mother of someone as wonderful as Erena-san
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.62,1:46:52.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,could make sweets like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.66,1:46:55.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Your mom was really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.98,1:46:58.28,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Here, of all places —
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.36,1:46:59.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'll probably lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.94,1:47:01.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.52,1:47:02.66,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,She's always amazing, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.74,1:47:05.82,Default,Eguchi Kokoha,0,0,60,,She sends in lots of treats for us,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.90,1:47:07.58,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and all gluten-free, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.66,1:47:09.68,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I tried copying her and made some —
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.76,1:47:12.38,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,I tried making gluten-free bagels,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.96,1:47:16.40,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and when I microwaved them, they smelled burnt,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.48,1:47:20.42,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,and they were so hard you'd break a tooth.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.50,1:47:23.02,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,So I thought Erena-san's mom is truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.10,1:47:25.16,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I really want her to teach me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.26,1:47:28.20,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,I want her to send them regularly.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.54,1:47:30.44,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I want them delivered!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.52,1:47:30.88,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.80,1:47:41.60,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,For me, Erena-san's smile is my absolute favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.18,1:47:44.92,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,In this Kokoten show,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.00,1:47:47.54,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,during songs, Erena-san and I are often
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.62,1:47:49.66,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,what we call "symme" —
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.24,1:47:53.00,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,"symme" means being in mirrored positions,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.40,1:47:54.34,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,with singing parts and so on,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.00,1:47:57.12,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and there are quite a few spots where our eyes meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.56,1:47:59.30,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,There are about five,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.90,1:48:02.44,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and in my own shows I'd always gotten all of them,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.52,1:48:05.42,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,but today, for some reason — maybe Erena-san was nervous —
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.50,1:48:08.80,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,she missed one of the five!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.50,1:48:12.52,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,And I thought, today's the last time,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.60,1:48:15.24,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and I failed to steal Erena-san's gaze.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.94,1:48:17.18,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,From here on, though —
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.26,1:48:18.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.08,1:48:18.72,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Are there more?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.22,1:48:19.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,There are.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.65,1:48:20.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Um, if there are —
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.50,1:48:21.08,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Let's make some!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.16,1:48:21.48,Default,Member,0,0,60,,A little —
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.10,1:48:25.36,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,I'll burn it in until my eyes go "zing,"
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.06,1:48:27.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and steal it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.20,1:48:28.92,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Not her legs — her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.30,1:48:31.06,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I'll steal her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.14,1:48:32.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Everyone's targeting different parts of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.42,1:48:33.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.58,1:48:36.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ere-chan's got it rough.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.34,1:48:37.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Because she's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.12,1:48:37.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.63,1:48:40.61,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,But what I thought was so Ere-chan:
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.69,1:48:42.31,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,I thought she might be nervous,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.39,1:48:45.21,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,but she stayed at her own pace right up to the last minute, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.27,1:48:49.35,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,She got her makeup done 40 minutes before today, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.43,1:48:51.29,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,When everyone said "40 minutes before?!"
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.37,1:48:53.81,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,she said, "No, that's early for me."
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.89,1:48:55.77,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.85,1:48:57.05,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really surprising.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.13,1:48:59.89,Default,Ihara Hanna,0,0,60,,She was brushing her teeth 30 seconds before the pre-show announcement.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.13,1:49:02.47,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And you make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.55,1:49:03.39,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.47,1:49:04.25,Default,Member,0,0,60,,As expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.33,1:49:06.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We learned that really, everyone here
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.39,1:49:08.33,Default,Member,0,0,60,,is a huge Erena-san fan,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.69,1:49:11.69,Default,Member,0,0,60,,so everyone, keep burning Erena-san into your eyes to the very end,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.77,1:49:13.97,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and let's make it a wonderful day.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.05,1:49:14.89,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Next —
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.43,1:49:18.13,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Well then, everyone, are you ready to keep the energy up?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.47,1:49:20.01,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.23,1:49:20.69,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.77,1:49:22.89,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Next, starting with this song.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.97,1:49:23.57,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Here you go!

; ===== mc4 =====
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.75,1:57:37.63,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Sukoshi Nigai Jinsei Sodan
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.71,1:57:39.61,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and Fumo no Tochi wo Mankai ni — you've just heard two songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.69,1:57:41.65,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Everyone, having fun?!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.65,1:57:45.95,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.98,1:57:50.38,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Fun times fly by — the next song really is the last one!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.42,1:57:56.66,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,Everyone, are you ready to send Ere-chan your love one last time?!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.84,1:57:59.72,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.44,1:58:04.93,Default,Member,0,0,60,,More!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.01,1:58:05.61,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.74,1:58:09.30,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then please listen: Saikyou Idol Yoroshiku!

; ===== mc5 =====
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.28,2:01:12.54,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,And so, you've just heard Saikyou Idol Yoroshiku!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.62,2:01:15.74,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Ere-chan, the main set is already over — how's it been?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.00,2:01:17.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It went by in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.48,2:01:18.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.20,2:01:22.96,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,But you all gave so many calls for every single song, I was happy,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.04,2:01:26.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and every song felt like such a warm space — it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.56,2:01:27.04,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.70,2:01:37.50,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,And so, from here we'd like Ere-chan to go get ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.96,2:01:38.90,Default,All,0,0,60,,See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.41,2:01:45.79,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,So while she gets ready, these members will talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.75,2:01:47.81,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Hina-tan, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.21,2:01:50.25,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's too much, huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.33,2:01:51.09,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,It's sad, huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.67,2:01:53.89,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is there anything you want to tell her?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.87,2:01:55.81,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Interview time?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.93,2:01:57.33,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,You couldn't tell her earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.41,2:01:59.19,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Better say it now.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.27,2:02:00.37,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.84,2:02:03.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then please pass that on to her.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.18,2:02:04.98,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I'll tell her.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.40,2:02:06.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,On the archive, right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.58,2:02:09.58,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,How's everyone? It's sad, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.66,2:02:10.96,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's sad.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.04,2:02:14.66,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,But when I asked her today, "Are you nervous?"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.74,2:02:16.24,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,she said, "Super nervous,"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.32,2:02:17.62,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,and when I asked, "Did you sleep last night?"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.70,2:02:18.96,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,she said, "Yeah, eight hours."
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.04,2:02:20.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,As expected.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.30,2:02:21.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So Ere-chan.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.28,2:02:25.00,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,It was surprising, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.08,2:02:27.34,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,If it were me, I wouldn't sleep a wink,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.10,2:02:30.44,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,but properly preparing for today is so Ere-tan-san.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.52,2:02:32.38,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,I thought that was cute.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.56,2:02:36.46,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I also had a very Erena-san moment:
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.86,2:02:41.96,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,DMM was streaming a revival of Team TII's "Te wo Tsunaginagara" show,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.04,2:02:43.26,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and I was watching it,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.34,2:02:46.92,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and Erena-san came out in the first-half/second-half MC,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.22,2:02:49.48,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and the host asked, "Does anyone have something?"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.56,2:02:51.28,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and Erena-san was the first to say "Yes!"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.62,2:02:53.28,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and when they said, "Go ahead, Ere-tan,"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.88,2:02:55.92,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,she started with, "My hangnail (sakamuke) just won't heal,"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.86,2:02:58.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,that kind of story —
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.92,2:03:01.14,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,"My hangnail just won't heal,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.22,2:03:04.00,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so maybe I'll become 'Sakamuke Erena.'" (sakamuke = hangnail, pun on Sakamoto)
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.70,2:03:06.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I might really remember that.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.18,2:03:08.98,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I was amazed that in an MC
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.06,2:03:10.56,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Erena-san would talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.98,2:03:11.94,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.54,2:03:14.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.26,2:03:15.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Has it healed by now?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.22,2:03:17.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I'm worried, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.76,2:03:21.00,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Seeing these people chatting reminded me —
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.08,2:03:22.62,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,she used to eat a pizza bun
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.70,2:03:23.58,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,every day.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.52,2:03:27.68,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,Apparently she likes meat buns now, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.76,2:03:29.60,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,From pizza buns to meat buns.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.68,2:03:30.90,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,She's grown up.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.84,2:03:35.64,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,So, there are lots of memories,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.72,2:03:37.82,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,and now we'd like to watch a video
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.90,2:03:39.64,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,full of memories together —
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.16,2:03:40.96,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,once we watch this,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.04,2:03:42.44,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,it'll really sink in, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.46,2:03:44.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's sad.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.28,2:03:46.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Are we okay, having talked about hangnails and pizza buns?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.54,2:03:48.06,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is that okay? I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.56,2:03:50.74,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,But wasn't it super cute —
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.78,2:03:52.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,the next one?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.62,2:03:54.72,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Super cute.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.80,2:03:57.16,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,You might want to put in some eye drops first.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.24,2:03:58.54,Default,Jitoe Nene,0,0,60,,Better watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.40,2:04:01.12,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,It's so cute you won't be able to blink,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.20,2:04:03.18,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,so please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.26,2:04:04.98,Default,Imamura Maria,0,0,60,,And so — the miracle video,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.06,2:04:06.95,Default,Member,0,0,60,,start!

; ===== movie_a =====
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.70,2:04:26.08,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Excuse me, I'd like to take a little of your time.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.16,2:04:29.10,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I, Sakamoto Erena, am graduating from HKT48.

; ===== movie_b =====
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.60,2:05:18.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm Sakamoto Erena, 1st year of junior high, age 13.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.03,2:05:21.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,My dream for the future
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.39,2:05:24.91,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,is to become a singer who can captivate lots of people, like Lady Gaga.

; ===== movie_c =====
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.72,2:06:21.07,Default,Announcer,0,0,60,,Ten members promoted.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.25,2:06:27.61,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm really, truly glad I've worked hard up to now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.69,2:06:29.95,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'll keep doing my best. Thank you!

; ===== movie_d =====
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.40,2:07:23.00,Default,Announcer,0,0,60,,Rank 87: HKT48 Team TII, Sakamoto Erena.

; ===== movie_d2 =====
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.80,2:07:35.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I love you all-chan!

; ===== movie_e =====
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.70,2:09:07.50,Default,Announcer,0,0,60,,Sakamoto Erena — Team KIV.

; ===== grad1 =====
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.50,2:15:18.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,You've just heard Mata Anata no Koto wo Kangaeteta.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.23,2:15:20.33,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.13,2:15:28.27,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This song
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.35,2:15:32.11,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,is the one that made me decide to work hard at singing.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.19,2:15:36.87,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Back when I'd never even been in the senbatsu for an HKT single,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.95,2:15:42.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I was chosen for the first time for a coupling song on an AKB CD single.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.25,2:15:48.01,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Back then I was really agonizing over what my strength should be,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.95,2:15:50.65,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and the recording director
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.73,2:15:53.33,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,praised my singing,
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.41,2:15:55.63,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and chose me because of that.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.61,2:15:58.41,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That became a huge turning point —
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.49,2:16:00.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it's the song that made me who I am today,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:01.33,2:16:05.23,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I wanted to sing it as one last song at my graduation show,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.03,2:16:07.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I chose it.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.27,2:16:07.79,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.53,2:16:16.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.24,2:16:18.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,For the next song,
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.80,2:16:21.60,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd like to sing with the members.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.04,2:16:22.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please listen.

; ===== grad2 =====
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.42,2:21:57.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,We 3rd-gens sang Sakura no Ki ni Narou — thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.44,2:22:06.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Mikurin, Emily and Mii-chan came for me — thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.15,2:22:13.65,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you, really — and your legs are so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:13.73,2:22:18.43,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The Ere-legs — the back's cute too. So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:18.51,2:22:18.99,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Isn't that crazy?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.53,2:22:22.17,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.68,2:22:27.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Singing with the 3rd gen brought back so many memories,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.84,2:22:29.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I cried.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:29.94,2:22:33.71,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You did so well.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.69,2:22:38.09,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.13,2:22:41.89,Default,Member,0,0,60,,4,195 days, it says.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.89,2:22:43.67,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:43.75,2:22:44.45,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.87,2:22:49.85,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,In the team, my same-gen friends
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.93,2:22:51.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,aren't around anymore,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:52.25,2:22:53.59,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and support, too —
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.67,2:22:55.51,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it's hard, alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:55.59,2:22:58.63,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Right now it feels like my big sisters came,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.83,2:23:01.49,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I just want to be spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.17,2:23:02.97,Default,Member,0,0,60,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.05,2:23:04.85,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Though she's younger.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.49,2:23:07.15,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True, she's younger, though.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.23,2:23:07.87,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Isn't it the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.27,2:23:10.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.39,2:23:13.69,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You're really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.36,2:23:18.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,But yesterday Mikurin called me,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.72,2:23:19.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I thought it was a greeting call, like "Ere-tan, see you tomorrow" —
Dialogue: 0,2:23:20.00,2:23:21.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that kind of thing —
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.06,2:23:23.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but it was "Mirun, how do you do the online check-in?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:23.94,2:23:24.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,How do you do it?"
Dialogue: 0,2:23:25.88,2:23:27.44,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,"Ask your manager!"
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.96,2:23:30.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I just now thought, "Did I call her?"
Dialogue: 0,2:23:30.66,2:23:31.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I did call her.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.26,2:23:31.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.92,2:23:35.96,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We've been in touch almost every day lately,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.04,2:23:37.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,so —
Dialogue: 0,2:23:37.32,2:23:38.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,ever since I graduated —
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.76,2:23:40.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,she even asked me about the dress.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:40.78,2:23:42.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So I knew.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.86,2:23:45.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I knew before everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.08,2:23:47.50,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The back is cute too.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:47.58,2:23:49.16,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Cute, really cute.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:49.24,2:23:50.16,Default,Member,0,0,60,,With a big ribbon on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:50.24,2:23:52.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Cute — thanks to the costume team.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:53.58,2:23:57.96,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Watching your history in the miracle video,
Dialogue: 0,2:23:58.42,2:24:02.04,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,I remembered how tiny you were.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.12,2:24:05.04,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I didn't think I was a kid myself,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.40,2:24:06.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but I really was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:06.38,2:24:07.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Totally a kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:07.08,2:24:08.32,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And I thought this:
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.40,2:24:10.88,Default,Member,0,0,60,,in the video, at the general election,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.40,2:24:12.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,that "everyone, what was it—" thing,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:12.88,2:24:15.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,like, "Wow, the guts to do that!"
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.30,2:24:18.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Like that — don't dig it up!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.54,2:24:20.68,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd finally made the ranking, so…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:20.76,2:24:22.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,You did "Miku-mon-mon" and stuff too!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.84,2:24:23.38,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:24.12,2:24:26.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,But a general election is a different kind of place, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.76,2:24:27.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Well, true.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:27.50,2:24:28.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I think it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:28.08,2:24:30.60,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Making it ring through the whole Nagoya Dome —
Dialogue: 0,2:24:31.20,2:24:31.76,Default,Member,0,0,60,,that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:31.84,2:24:33.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.28,2:24:35.68,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I thought looking back later it'd be a good memory.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:35.76,2:24:36.56,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You've grown up, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:36.64,2:24:40.36,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really — because there was a "serious" phase, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:40.44,2:24:43.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,People who've watched her for a long time will know,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.16,2:24:45.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,she got pegged with a "serious" character,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:45.66,2:24:46.96,Default,Member,0,0,60,,yes, yes — that image,
Dialogue: 0,2:24:47.04,2:24:49.96,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and Ere-tan was quite troubled by it.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:50.36,2:24:52.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She even called me
Dialogue: 0,2:24:52.64,2:24:55.69,Default,Member,0,0,60,,saying "I hate being called serious."
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.77,2:24:56.81,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:56.89,2:25:00.51,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I got this earnest worry, "I hate it,"
Dialogue: 0,2:25:01.25,2:25:04.01,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and I listened, saying "Yeah, being called serious is the worst,"
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.09,2:25:05.09,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and so on.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.17,2:25:08.67,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It was frustrating to be summed up in one word —
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.75,2:25:10.97,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd think, "But I'm not serious!"
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.05,2:25:12.43,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You've got so many sides, like your funny side.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:13.17,2:25:15.53,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It was a time I wanted people to see more of me,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:15.61,2:25:17.05,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I hated being boxed in as serious.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.13,2:25:18.55,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,There was a time like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:18.63,2:25:19.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,There was, but —
Dialogue: 0,2:25:20.58,2:25:21.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,thank you, really.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.78,2:25:23.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Wow, Mikurin talks so much!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:23.88,2:25:25.56,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.92,2:25:28.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She was sleeping until the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.34,2:25:29.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.86,2:25:31.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She's tired after all.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.22,2:25:34.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,She's been sitting in Ere's makeup chair the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.60,2:25:37.32,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:37.70,2:25:39.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Sit on top of me, then!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.76,2:25:40.72,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No way, no way.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.80,2:25:42.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Move over, then.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.58,2:25:48.24,Default,Tanaka Miku,0,0,60,,When I was napping, what was the first thing I said to Yuuna when I woke up?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:48.32,2:25:50.18,Default,Tanaka Miku,0,0,60,,The moment I woke up,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.26,2:25:51.12,Default,Tanaka Miku,0,0,60,,I said "Good morning," and then,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:51.20,2:25:52.34,Default,Tanaka Miku,0,0,60,,"Huh? Yuuna, are you in the show today?"
Dialogue: 0,2:25:52.42,2:25:53.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We're the same gen!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.26,2:25:54.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No, no, no —
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.18,2:25:54.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Same gen!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.94,2:25:56.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Because we're on different teams —
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.26,2:25:56.84,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,That's weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:57.36,2:25:59.16,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,We even rehearsed together!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.24,2:26:01.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I didn't just sneak in here, you know!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:01.30,2:26:02.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She's still a member, after all.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:02.50,2:26:02.85,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:02.93,2:26:04.82,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Mikurin got a proper massage
Dialogue: 0,2:26:04.90,2:26:06.12,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,and had her makeup done properly too —
Dialogue: 0,2:26:06.20,2:26:07.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,They don't really
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.08,2:26:08.28,Default,Member,0,0,60,,dance that much, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:08.36,2:26:08.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Kind of —
Dialogue: 0,2:26:08.86,2:26:10.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,it's going well.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.12,2:26:11.96,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So I could be in it from the first song —
Dialogue: 0,2:26:12.04,2:26:13.48,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Darling, darling" —
Dialogue: 0,2:26:13.56,2:26:14.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Remember? Remember?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:14.72,2:26:16.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Excuse me, the main show is already over!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:19.22,2:26:19.86,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:19.94,2:26:21.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really funny.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.10,2:26:22.74,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:23.96,2:26:25.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Trying to wrap it up with that.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:25.18,2:26:26.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:26.72,2:26:29.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Saying that kind of thing to a same-gen — not good.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:31.04,2:26:31.82,Default,Member,0,0,60,,As expected.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:31.90,2:26:32.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.00,2:26:34.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,My tears dried up.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.88,2:26:38.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Don't jerk us around.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.54,2:26:40.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ishio-san will get mad at us.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:40.98,2:26:43.56,Default,Member,0,0,60,,How long are we allowed to talk?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:43.64,2:26:44.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.84,2:26:46.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Misha-kin hasn't said anything — is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:46.20,2:26:47.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then, Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:47.48,2:26:48.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:51.72,2:26:52.36,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.44,2:26:54.44,Default,Member,0,0,60,,This isn't school.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:55.17,2:26:57.21,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She was here until recently, this one.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:57.29,2:26:58.07,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Still, right.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.19,2:27:01.23,Default,Aramaki Misaki,0,0,60,,So among the graduates, I'm the one
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.31,2:27:02.13,Default,Aramaki Misaki,0,0,60,,who was here most recently.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.21,2:27:04.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:04.39,2:27:05.55,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Don't you have anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.35,2:27:08.47,Default,Member,0,0,60,,This video —
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.55,2:27:11.11,Default,Member,0,0,60,,it was a daydream, I was jealous.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:11.19,2:27:12.27,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What was it like for yours, Mii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:12.35,2:27:13.29,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Support? — Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:13.37,2:27:15.81,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Don't say such mean things!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:15.97,2:27:18.21,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Wait! — It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:18.29,2:27:19.89,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's not that the support was bad — It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.00,2:27:21.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's not "Frame You," so…
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.70,2:27:22.52,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Like, it's already —
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.30,2:27:26.88,Default,Member,0,0,60,,it's not even our own show.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.96,2:27:28.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,This isn't an off-line meetup!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:29.42,2:27:30.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's my stage, technically.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:31.18,2:27:32.00,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's fine, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:32.08,2:27:33.48,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Huh, did Emily have complaints?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:33.56,2:27:35.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's fine, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:35.12,2:27:37.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,This can't be a complaints meeting,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:37.32,2:27:39.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,so Emily needs no airtime.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:39.10,2:27:41.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I don't even remember what played in mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:41.22,2:27:41.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.38,2:27:44.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I really need no airtime.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.16,2:27:45.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Um, too much —
Dialogue: 0,2:27:45.42,2:27:46.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,too much.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:46.86,2:27:48.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Everyone who appears always brings it up.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:48.50,2:27:49.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:50.20,2:27:52.12,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,But I properly thought about the line splits too —
Dialogue: 0,2:27:52.20,2:27:55.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,the order, "I want to sing this lyric with this member" —
Dialogue: 0,2:27:55.24,2:27:56.36,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I thought it all through.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:56.44,2:27:59.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I thought it was really well done, and it was Ere-tan!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:59.16,2:28:00.20,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Yep, I planned it.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:00.28,2:28:03.66,Default,Member,0,0,60,,From what point of view are you planning?!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:06.29,2:28:08.51,Default,Member,0,0,60,,This feels nice — so nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:09.17,2:28:11.27,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ugh, I don't want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:12.61,2:28:14.13,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I want to stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:14.21,2:28:16.25,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Technically our time is fixed — our slot.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:16.33,2:28:16.87,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:16.95,2:28:20.01,Default,Member,0,0,60,,There'll be a signal saying "time to head back."
Dialogue: 0,2:28:20.09,2:28:21.25,Default,Member,0,0,60,,But the lamp's not on.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:21.33,2:28:21.97,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No, no —
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.05,2:28:24.83,Default,Member,0,0,60,,they're being considerate and not turning it on.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.39,2:28:26.45,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.53,2:28:27.11,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Huh, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.19,2:28:27.89,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Huh, is that what it means?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:28.07,2:28:29.99,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No, no — someone be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.07,2:28:30.97,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's on, it's on, it's on!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:31.05,2:28:32.09,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:32.17,2:28:33.23,Default,Member,0,0,60,,They're telling us to go home.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.31,2:28:34.39,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Huh, telling us to leave?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:35.33,2:28:36.27,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.35,2:28:39.19,Default,Member,0,0,60,,But the nice ones are saying "No, no!"
Dialogue: 0,2:28:39.27,2:28:39.65,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Well then —

; ===== grad3 =====
Dialogue: 0,2:28:41.80,2:28:43.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then we'll keep on staying put!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:43.34,2:28:45.58,Default,Member,0,0,60,,This isn't a talk show!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:45.66,2:28:47.32,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Not a talk show.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.40,2:28:49.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Let's head back for now.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:49.10,2:28:50.96,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Let's wrap up for now.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.76,2:28:52.82,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We're going home!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:52.90,2:28:53.86,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Maybe we'll come again.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:55.16,2:28:56.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Sorry for intruding!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:56.72,2:28:57.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:04.14,2:29:04.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:04.78,2:29:08.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Was today a talk show?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:10.26,2:29:10.61,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:10.69,2:29:14.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Yeah — they're such a fun bunch, my 3rd gen;
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.61,2:29:17.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,whenever I see them I get energy. I love my same-gen friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.55,2:29:20.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay — from here, I'd like to talk to all of you
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.99,2:29:23.91,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,on my own.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:24.05,2:29:26.91,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Once again: to everyone who came here today,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:26.99,2:29:29.29,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,to everyone watching the stream,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.37,2:29:31.47,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and to everyone watching from the theater lobby —
Dialogue: 0,2:29:31.55,2:29:34.25,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,thank you so, so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:43.18,2:29:47.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Wearing this dress now and watching the video,
Dialogue: 0,2:29:47.24,2:29:51.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it's finally sinking in: "Oh, I'm really graduating."
Dialogue: 0,2:29:51.88,2:29:54.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Looking back, it's been about eleven and a half years.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:56.37,2:30:00.29,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,When I think about what kind of eleven years they were for me,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:00.37,2:30:04.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I think they were eleven years of just wanting so badly to become somebody,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:04.39,2:30:08.63,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and struggling to get there.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.90,2:30:13.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's not that I loved idols like crazy,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:13.84,2:30:15.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,or was super interested in them.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:15.56,2:30:17.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I just wanted to try standing on this stage —
Dialogue: 0,2:30:18.42,2:30:22.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,not quite curiosity, more an excited feeling of "I want to try applying,"
Dialogue: 0,2:30:22.14,2:30:24.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I applied and got to join.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:25.00,2:30:30.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I came into HKT and learned about idols here,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:31.18,2:30:34.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but at first, once I was actually in,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:34.84,2:30:37.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I looked around and it was nothing but really cute girls,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:38.00,2:30:38.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:39.26,2:30:40.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and there were so many of us,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:41.71,2:30:43.49,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that I completely lost my confidence.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:44.91,2:30:45.91,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Being able to have confidence
Dialogue: 0,2:30:45.99,2:30:47.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,in myself
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.39,2:30:50.45,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,only came in the last few years.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.53,2:30:52.01,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Really, at first,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:53.17,2:30:54.13,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,my same-gen friends got in
Dialogue: 0,2:30:54.21,2:30:55.15,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,the senbatsu before me,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:55.23,2:30:57.01,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,got promoted before me, and so on —
Dialogue: 0,2:30:58.05,2:30:59.77,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it was one setback after another,
Dialogue: 0,2:30:59.85,2:31:01.47,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,when I look back on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:01.55,2:31:02.59,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,That's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:03.11,2:31:06.33,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Every time, I wondered, "What's my strength?"
Dialogue: 0,2:31:06.41,2:31:09.01,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,"To shine among this many people,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:09.55,2:31:12.09,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,what should I work on, and how?"
Dialogue: 0,2:31:12.17,2:31:17.25,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I was always searching, and kept working hard.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:17.81,2:31:21.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,But when I think about why I was able to keep standing on this stage
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.88,2:31:24.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and working so hard,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:24.36,2:31:28.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it's because all of you fans meant so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:28.08,2:31:31.08,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Whenever anything happened, you were there,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.16,2:31:33.77,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so I'd think, "I'll do my best for everyone."
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.85,2:31:38.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Truly, all of you were the driving force of my eleven years.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.00,2:31:40.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:47.19,2:31:47.67,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Let's see…
Dialogue: 0,2:31:49.25,2:31:52.09,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I think people strongly associate me with singing,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.22,2:31:57.12,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but after I came here, like I just said,
Dialogue: 0,2:31:58.07,2:32:02.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I wondered how I should work to shine here,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:02.54,2:32:04.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and the strength I chose was singing —
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.80,2:32:07.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,what I found was singing.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:07.26,2:32:09.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Of course I love singing,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:10.00,2:32:12.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I love standing on stage,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:13.56,2:32:16.04,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but like Mikurin said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:17.26,2:32:19.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,people called me "serious" at first,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:21.20,2:32:24.20,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and being summed up in one word
Dialogue: 0,2:32:24.28,2:32:26.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,was something I really hated —
Dialogue: 0,2:32:27.24,2:32:29.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,there was a time like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:30.90,2:32:33.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,There was even a time
Dialogue: 0,2:32:33.24,2:32:36.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,when I was the one who accepted myself the least.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:36.40,2:32:37.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd think,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:38.00,2:32:41.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,"If only I had a personality like this, I'd be suited to being an idol."
Dialogue: 0,2:32:42.62,2:32:45.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I honestly never once thought I was suited to being an idol,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:46.26,2:32:49.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but every time you praised me so much at handshake events,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:50.76,2:32:53.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,or told me "That part was great,"
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.60,2:32:56.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'd feel like, "Oh, I'm really shining."
Dialogue: 0,2:32:56.58,2:32:58.36,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Truly, it was your words, everyone,
Dialogue: 0,2:32:59.58,2:33:02.04,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that built my life as an idol,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:02.12,2:33:04.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and let me become so positive.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:04.82,2:33:06.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So people call me positive,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:06.36,2:33:09.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but I'm actually someone who overthinks a lot,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:10.06,2:33:14.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I'm oddly particular about strange things —
Dialogue: 0,2:33:15.38,2:33:20.12,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and that someone like me can now sing on stage with this much confidence
Dialogue: 0,2:33:20.20,2:33:24.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,is, without a doubt, thanks to all of you fans.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:26.93,2:33:31.21,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I said this a little at my birthday show a few years ago, too:
Dialogue: 0,2:33:31.29,2:33:35.02,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I think of you fans as the sun,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:35.10,2:33:38.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and myself as something like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:38.64,2:33:41.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Idols are so sparkly
Dialogue: 0,2:33:42.70,2:33:47.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that many people might think of them as the sun,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:47.08,2:33:47.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but for me it's the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.14,2:33:51.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Just as the moon can't shine without the sun's light,
Dialogue: 0,2:33:51.78,2:33:54.44,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it's because you fans are here
Dialogue: 0,2:33:54.52,2:33:56.74,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that I could become an idol like this
Dialogue: 0,2:33:56.82,2:33:58.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and sparkle —
Dialogue: 0,2:33:58.50,2:34:01.96,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and because the costume team made me a dress like this,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:02.04,2:34:05.36,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and the makeup team did my hair so beautifully,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:05.44,2:34:09.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and because there's lighting like this, I can shine.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:09.72,2:34:15.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So I could never have walked these eleven years on my own.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:15.46,2:34:20.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,To everyone who has been involved in my activities until now —
Dialogue: 0,2:34:20.74,2:34:23.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,the people I've worked with,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:23.26,2:34:25.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,the fans, and the members, and my family —
Dialogue: 0,2:34:26.02,2:34:30.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,please let me say here: thank you, truly, to every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.60,2:34:32.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:40.80,2:34:42.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Um, where should I start…
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.56,2:34:46.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Then, if I may use this moment,
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.02,2:34:52.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,please let me thank my parents.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:58.08,2:35:02.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Mom, you always drove me there and picked me up,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.44,2:35:08.78,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,there were times we really fought at home,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:10.35,2:35:13.43,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,times I came home tired from work and took it out on you,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.54,2:35:16.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,or said things I didn't mean —
Dialogue: 0,2:35:18.17,2:35:19.29,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,there were times like that,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:19.37,2:35:21.73,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but you always made me delicious food,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:22.27,2:35:24.21,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and even today, for all the members,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:24.65,2:35:29.51,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,you made a delicious gluten-free cake.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.75,2:35:31.79,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I don't really —
Dialogue: 0,2:35:31.87,2:35:34.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,actually, I don't talk about work with you much,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:34.39,2:35:37.95,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but the way you've watched over me from a little distance,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:38.35,2:35:40.97,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,quietly and warmly,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:41.05,2:35:42.95,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,made things so much easier for me,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.73,2:35:45.87,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I'm truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:45.95,2:35:48.37,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you for raising me this far.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:55.87,2:35:56.99,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,And Dad.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:57.69,2:36:00.25,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Dad, you're very quiet —
Dialogue: 0,2:36:00.33,2:36:02.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,you hardly talk at all at home,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:02.65,2:36:06.99,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but once you've had a drink you talk and talk.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:07.57,2:36:11.49,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,When we've toasted together, or had a little to drink,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:12.55,2:36:16.11,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I could really feel
Dialogue: 0,2:36:16.19,2:36:17.81,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,how much you've been supporting me.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.44,2:36:20.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,You don't say much,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:20.32,2:36:21.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but that one line, "Do your best, Ere,"
Dialogue: 0,2:36:21.98,2:36:25.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,always went straight to my heart,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:26.23,2:36:29.03,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I always thought
Dialogue: 0,2:36:29.11,2:36:31.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I wanted to repay you through my work.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:32.73,2:36:36.65,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,At home you even wear my birthday-show T-shirts
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.73,2:36:37.87,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,as pajamas,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:38.00,2:36:40.26,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and from the very beginning,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:40.34,2:36:41.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,since I was little,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.98,2:36:44.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,without saying much,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:44.30,2:36:46.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,you watched over me warmly,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:46.36,2:36:47.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and it was such a support.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:48.16,2:36:49.11,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:56.34,2:36:58.62,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,And to all the members:
Dialogue: 0,2:36:59.98,2:37:01.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,thank you for teasing someone as free-spirited as me
Dialogue: 0,2:37:03.34,2:37:04.08,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so much,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:04.16,2:37:05.12,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,for playing along with me,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:05.20,2:37:07.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,for going out to eat with me so often,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:08.02,2:37:08.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,for talking to me —
Dialogue: 0,2:37:09.40,2:37:10.92,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:11.00,2:37:14.84,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The first team I was promoted to
Dialogue: 0,2:37:14.92,2:37:16.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,was Team TII.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:17.04,2:37:19.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Back then there were lots of my same-gen friends,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:21.02,2:37:22.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it was comfortable,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:22.54,2:37:24.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and there were members I could lean on right beside me,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:25.02,2:37:26.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so it was fun —
Dialogue: 0,2:37:26.08,2:37:30.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but TII was disbanded a while ago,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:30.24,2:37:33.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I moved to this team, KIV.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:34.48,2:37:38.84,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Right after I moved to KIV, I really —
Dialogue: 0,2:37:39.66,2:37:40.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,let's see —
Dialogue: 0,2:37:40.36,2:37:42.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I struggled quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:42.80,2:37:47.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The distance with the younger members was hard to judge,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:49.50,2:37:51.20,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,like, "What do I do?"
Dialogue: 0,2:37:51.84,2:37:55.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,When none of my same-gen friends were left in KIV,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:55.58,2:37:56.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I was in real despair,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:58.48,2:38:02.97,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and there were times I went home alone and cried.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:04.25,2:38:07.09,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,There were times I felt lonely,
Dialogue: 0,2:38:07.17,2:38:09.05,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but once I opened my heart —
Dialogue: 0,2:38:09.13,2:38:12.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so really, everyone — everyone in KIV
Dialogue: 0,2:38:12.83,2:38:15.71,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,was so warm and so kind,
Dialogue: 0,2:38:17.16,2:38:20.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,saying things like "I love this about you, Erena-san" or "Let's go eat,"
Dialogue: 0,2:38:21.62,2:38:25.88,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so many times, and we got close so quickly,
Dialogue: 0,2:38:27.25,2:38:32.69,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and right now I really think I'm glad I became part of KIV.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:35.43,2:38:37.71,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So thank you for teasing me so warmly,
Dialogue: 0,2:38:38.18,2:38:40.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,for accepting my free-spirited side,
Dialogue: 0,2:38:42.20,2:38:43.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,for letting me
Dialogue: 0,2:38:43.98,2:38:45.12,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,push myself alongside you —
Dialogue: 0,2:38:45.20,2:38:46.96,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:47.04,2:38:48.84,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Because it was all of you in KIV,
Dialogue: 0,2:38:48.92,2:38:51.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I've been able to enjoy it this far.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:51.42,2:38:52.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you, really.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:00.24,2:39:01.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,And the costume team:
Dialogue: 0,2:39:01.36,2:39:03.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,thank you for making such a wonderful costume.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:03.60,2:39:04.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:05.24,2:39:08.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I said I wanted to show off my Ere-legs,
Dialogue: 0,2:39:08.62,2:39:09.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so — vroom! —
Dialogue: 0,2:39:10.22,2:39:11.10,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,on the back, too,
Dialogue: 0,2:39:11.50,2:39:13.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,you put on a cute ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:13.66,2:39:16.36,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,And it's the most beautiful dress in the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:16.76,2:39:18.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:20.06,2:39:23.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The makeup team, too — you always do my hair beautifully,
Dialogue: 0,2:39:23.42,2:39:25.08,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and since I always leave getting ready to the last minute,
Dialogue: 0,2:39:25.58,2:39:27.52,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,you always get me ready in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:27.60,2:39:29.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:29.14,2:39:31.02,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you for always making me an idol.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:34.02,2:39:36.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,And the managers and staff:
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.26,2:39:39.10,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,thank you so much for these eleven years.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:41.29,2:39:43.77,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm not at all put-together,
Dialogue: 0,2:39:44.75,2:39:45.85,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I do things at my own pace,
Dialogue: 0,2:39:45.93,2:39:49.61,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and you supported someone like me from right beside me.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:50.59,2:39:52.23,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:55.33,2:40:00.19,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I really feel I was blessed with a wonderful environment.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:01.32,2:40:03.90,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,With so many members it might be tough,
Dialogue: 0,2:40:03.98,2:40:07.62,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but — I know, who am I to say this — please take care of HKT48 from here on.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:07.70,2:40:08.78,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:15.33,2:40:16.51,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,And all of you fans:
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.59,2:40:21.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,once again, thank you so much for all your love over these eleven years.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:23.30,2:40:26.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I really did struggle,
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.88,2:40:30.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and there were times I got negative,
Dialogue: 0,2:40:30.38,2:40:33.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but that I could welcome this day so happily,
Dialogue: 0,2:40:33.98,2:40:37.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,with a smile, is truly thanks to all of you —
Dialogue: 0,2:40:38.00,2:40:38.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,to you, my fans.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:39.36,2:40:42.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The power of fans
Dialogue: 0,2:40:42.50,2:40:46.14,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,is so much greater than you think —
Dialogue: 0,2:40:47.46,2:40:49.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it really gives us energy.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:51.40,2:40:53.62,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So even though I'm leaving idol life,
Dialogue: 0,2:40:54.20,2:40:56.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,please keep supporting the members
Dialogue: 0,2:40:57.14,2:40:59.44,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so, so much from here on.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:59.90,2:41:01.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,It's because you're here
Dialogue: 0,2:41:01.58,2:41:04.48,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that we're truly able to be idols.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.56,2:41:09.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Because of the magic of you, our fans,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:09.32,2:41:12.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,we can sparkle and shine on stage like this,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:12.72,2:41:17.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so please keep supporting me, and HKT, from here on.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:26.48,2:41:29.70,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This world is really unusual —
Dialogue: 0,2:41:30.54,2:41:32.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,there are positions,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:33.02,2:41:36.82,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,center, senbatsu, all sorts of things,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:36.90,2:41:38.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I struggled with them too,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:40.44,2:41:46.24,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but what I think now is: if you can be yourself, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:47.76,2:41:51.96,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I used to sort of reject the too-serious me,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:52.68,2:41:54.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I struggled with lots of things,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:54.74,2:41:57.18,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but you fans made me feel
Dialogue: 0,2:41:57.26,2:42:01.22,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,that as long as I'm me, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:02.74,2:42:05.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So to all the members, too —
Dialogue: 0,2:42:06.10,2:42:10.94,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,the younger ones may struggle a lot from here on,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:11.02,2:42:13.68,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,but if you keep working hard, honestly and straight ahead —
Dialogue: 0,2:42:14.86,2:42:20.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,if you work hard with a little ingenuity, good things will come.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:21.72,2:42:25.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I hope that in the end, in my own way,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:25.46,2:42:29.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I could show that to the younger members and the group by example.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:29.76,2:42:34.02,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,When I wondered at the very end whether I'd left anything undone —
Dialogue: 0,2:42:34.10,2:42:35.46,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I got to do the singing show,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:38.00,2:42:43.34,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I worked so hard on my singing — I truly have no regrets,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:45.98,2:42:49.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I think I really did work hard.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:50.30,2:42:54.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I've come this far truly supported by all of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:56.36,2:43:01.28,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,From now on, singing, TV work, whatever I want to do —
Dialogue: 0,2:43:01.36,2:43:05.16,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I want to be honest with myself and, at my own pace,
Dialogue: 0,2:43:05.24,2:43:08.30,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,take on all kinds of challenges I want to try.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:11.62,2:43:17.42,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Also, I'll be singing the official theme song for Mynavi Tour de Kyushu.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:25.32,2:43:30.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,So I want to keep on singing,
Dialogue: 0,2:43:31.52,2:43:36.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,and I want to keep entertaining all of you,
Dialogue: 0,2:43:36.64,2:43:38.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,so even though I won't be an idol anymore,
Dialogue: 0,2:43:38.58,2:43:41.86,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,please support the new me from here on, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:50.14,2:43:52.02,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,These eleven years, I was truly happy.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:52.10,2:43:54.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:04.04,2:44:05.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This is a bit of a plug, but
Dialogue: 0,2:44:05.14,2:44:06.56,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,my radio show continues too —
Dialogue: 0,2:44:07.68,2:44:08.64,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,it's Sakamoto Erena's
Dialogue: 0,2:44:08.72,2:44:10.72,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,"What Is Okehazama?" show.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:10.80,2:44:11.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please listen!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:11.84,2:44:12.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:20.67,2:44:21.83,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,2:44:22.27,2:44:23.99,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,shall I call everyone out?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:24.07,2:44:25.63,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone, please come out!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:36.60,2:44:37.32,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Well then, everyone —
Dialogue: 0,2:44:38.00,2:44:40.32,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,are you ready for the last song?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:40.58,2:44:42.38,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Awww!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:44.52,2:44:46.96,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Aww, so gloomy!
Dialogue: 0,2:44:48.46,2:44:50.98,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone, are you ready to do the calls one last time?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:53.83,2:44:54.27,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!

; ===== final =====
Dialogue: 0,2:53:07.19,2:53:08.39,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:08.81,2:53:09.89,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:10.89,2:53:13.21,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The day has come for me to pass through here.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:14.81,2:53:19.54,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Shall I go through?
Dialogue: 0,2:53:20.83,2:53:21.25,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Well then —
Dialogue: 0,2:53:42.85,2:53:44.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,For about eleven and a half years,
Dialogue: 0,2:53:44.25,2:53:46.99,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,thank you so, so much for all your love.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:48.05,2:53:49.53,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Off toward my next dream —
Dialogue: 0,2:53:49.61,2:53:51.00,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:51.08,2:53:52.50,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,2:54:04.80,2:54:06.38,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,The show's over!
Dialogue: 0,2:54:09.10,2:54:10.80,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I've gone and graduated — "shimota"!
Dialogue: 1,2:54:09.10,2:54:14.80,Default,Note,0,0,60,,{\an8}Note: しもた (shimota), a dialect form of "went and did it"; the members are teasing her for it
Dialogue: 0,2:54:10.84,2:54:11.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Shimota!"
Dialogue: 0,2:54:11.84,2:54:12.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Shimota~!"
Dialogue: 0,2:54:12.94,2:54:14.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Shimota!"
Dialogue: 0,2:54:16.44,2:54:19.77,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,In my speech I said a little something to everyone in KIV —
Dialogue: 0,2:54:19.85,2:54:20.75,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We heard it!
Dialogue: 0,2:54:20.83,2:54:21.39,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We were listening!
Dialogue: 0,2:54:21.47,2:54:23.07,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:23.61,2:54:24.15,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I cried.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:24.23,2:54:24.58,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:24.66,2:54:28.57,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Because at the end I could really feel that I'm glad it was KIV.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:29.23,2:54:30.69,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:54:33.13,2:54:34.31,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:37.45,2:54:40.13,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,But it was so much fun, really.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:40.83,2:54:42.43,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Sorry about that — thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:47.06,2:54:49.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,How's this? I'm the only one who can talk —
Dialogue: 0,2:54:51.00,2:54:52.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,2:54:53.46,2:54:54.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You're so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:55.62,2:54:57.54,Default,Takemoto Kurumi,0,0,60,,I'm taking over her legs right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:54:58.32,2:55:00.06,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,My skirt — you'll see under it!
Dialogue: 0,2:55:00.30,2:55:01.48,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Over here, over here.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:01.64,2:55:02.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So pretty.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:06.06,2:55:07.44,Default,Kuriyama Rina,0,0,60,,Hina-san, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:07.52,2:55:07.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:08.02,2:55:08.50,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:09.82,2:55:12.10,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,What I wanted to tell you earlier —
Dialogue: 0,2:55:12.32,2:55:12.76,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,What?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:13.04,2:55:14.08,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,2:55:14.94,2:55:16.54,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I love you too!
Dialogue: 0,2:55:18.60,2:55:21.17,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you so much, really.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:22.35,2:55:24.53,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Great work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:24.63,2:55:26.59,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Everyone, do your best.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:29.49,2:55:32.23,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,I'm cheering for all of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:32.31,2:55:35.47,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Please keep supporting me, and supporting everyone, from here on.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:37.04,2:55:39.84,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Okay — is this alright?
Dialogue: 0,2:55:39.92,2:55:43.66,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Then please look forward to the next show too — I won't be in it, but look forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,2:55:43.72,2:55:45.40,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Thank you for my graduation show!
Dialogue: 0,2:55:46.50,2:55:46.86,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:55:51.15,2:55:53.75,Default,Sakamoto Erena,0,0,60,,Oh — "toward your dream"? Let's send her off.
Dialogue: 0,2:55:56.64,2:55:58.66,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ere-tan, toward your shining dream —
Dialogue: 0,2:55:59.10,2:56:00.50,Default,All,0,0,60,,have a good trip!
